      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i need to run something by u... i've been doing this thing where i focus on the ticker symbols for a few mins before the market opens, just like a rhythmic breathing thing to sync up with the data flow. today i was staring at the yen/usd spread and i felt this huge spike of pressure in my head right when the price hit a specific micro-level, and like a second later the algos just... shifted. it felt intentional. like there was a specific pattern in the volatility that actually matched my breathing. can u check the 10:15 am candle for us? i think there was a weird rhythmic oscillation there that doesn't look like normal noise.",
